units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
atom_modify     map array

read_data       start.data

pair_style      hybrid/overlay tabgap eam/fs
pair_coeff      * * tabgap /home/lammpsuser/HEA_Irr_ML_study/ML_potentials/tabGAP/W-Ta-Cr-V/Cr-Ta-V-W.tabgap Cr Ta V W
pair_coeff      * * eam/fs /home/lammpsuser/HEA_Irr_ML_study/ML_potentials/tabGAP/W-Ta-Cr-V/Cr-Ta-V-W.eam.fs Cr Ta V W

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes

fix             box all box/relax iso 0.0 vmax 0.001
minimize        1.0e-8 1.0e-6 5000 50000
write_data      relaxed.data
